  /* ── Popover panel ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
     Same overlay pattern as the header dropdown: var(--bg) at 95% +
     backdrop-blur, hairline divider rows, no shadows beyond a soft drop
     for depth. Anchor triangle uses the same surface so panel + anchor
